ation bar, a prominent search bar on the home page, a sidebar for search history, and a main content area for trending showcases and statistics. User profile and repository pages use card and grid layouts, with interactive charts and activity calendars. The design is clean, modern, and responsive, using only CSS for styling."\n}'}",
